{'symbol': 'FICO', 'date': '2021-08-19 08:00:00', 'title': "FICO RECOGNIZED ON FORBES' LIST OF AMERICA'S BEST EMPLOYERS FOR WOMEN", 'text': "SAN JOSE, CALIF., AUG. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HIGHLIGHTS FICO INCLUDED ON FORBES' ANNUAL LIST OF AMERICA'S BEST EMPLOYERS FOR WOMEN THE RECOGNITION IS BASED ON EMPLOYEE SATISFACTION THROUGH ANONYMIZED SURVEYS FICO WAS RECOGNIZED BY FORBES AS AMERICA'S NUMBER ONE MID-SIZED EMPLOYER IN FEBRUARY LEADING DIGITAL DECISION PLATFORM COMPANY,\xa0FICO, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN NAMED AMONG AMERICA'S BEST EMPLOYERS FOR WOMEN BY\xa0FORBES\xa0MAGAZINE IN THE SOFTWARE & SERVICES CATEGORY."}